<urn:atm:triage:finding/AO211-RENDER-F003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AO211-RENDER-F003" ;
  triage:title "AC4 SVG chart test coverage narrower than golden 2x2-grid requirement" ;
  triage:description "Sprint AO2.11 AC4 requires fixture-driven golden test rendering 2 hosts x 4 targets x mixed PASS/FAIL, asserting candle count, series count, FAIL styling, and baseline line presence. req-qa (ATM-QA-003) and quality-mgr inspection: test_chart_geometry_has_all_candles_series_fail_outline_and_baselines only checks candlestick_series() dict for single target (tcp), not full rendered markup across 2x2 grid, and is not golden/reference-file test. quality-mgr visually confirmed FAIL styling and baseline lines render correctly in index.html. This is coverage gap versus AC4 literal wording, not active functional defect." ;
